        <part lastModifyTime="0" updateMethod="0">
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="1" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:02,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:08,150</end-time>
                <translation>500年来 历代掌权者传读不断的《君主论》</translation>
                <original>500年にわたって時の権力者たちが読み継いできた君主論</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="2" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:09,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:13,496</end-time>
                <translation>作者马基雅维利通过外交官的工作</translation>
                <original>作者マキャベリーは外交官の仕事を通じて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="3" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:13,496</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:16,075</end-time>
                <translation>见识了许多领导者的形象</translation>
                <original>多くのリーダーの姿を見てきました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="4" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:19,701</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:24,240</end-time>
                <translation>马基雅维利从中所选择的理想领导者是</translation>
                <original>その中でマキャベリーが選んだ理想のリーダーとは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="5" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:26,116</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:29,306</end-time>
                <translation>100分de名著《君主论》</translation>
                <original>100分de名著君主論</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="6" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:29,306</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:34,025</end-time>
                <translation>指南老师是曾翻译《马基雅维利全集》的武田好</translation>
                <original>指南役はマキャベリー全集の翻訳を手掛けた武田好さん</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="7" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:35,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:40,775</end-time>
                <translation>君主身上有野兽的部分和人的部分</translation>
                <original>君主には野獣の部分と人間の部分がいるんだと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="8" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:40,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:45,728</end-time>
                <translation>那种野兽 也就是君主应当学习的动物</translation>
                <original>その野獣つまり君主が学ぶべき動物には</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="9" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:45,728</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:46,775</end-time>
                <translation>有两种</translation>
                <original>2つありますよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="10" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:00:46,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:48,200</end-time>
                <translation>意思是有两种野兽值得君主学习么？</translation>
                <original>野獣の中に2つあるってことですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="11" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:48,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:50,325</end-time>
                <translation>是的</translation>
                <original>そうなんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="12" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:50,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:55,500</end-time>
                <translation>第2回将解读在当今时代也通用的领导者资质</translation>
                <original>第2回は今の世にも通じるリーダーの資質を読み解きます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="13" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:20,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:26,175</end-time>
                <translation>第2回　成为领袖的条件</translation>
                <original>第2回　「リーダーの条件とは」</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="14" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:29,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:31,880</end-time>
                <translation>人人都曾想读一次</translation>
                <original>誰もが一度は読んでみたいと思いながら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="15" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:31,880</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:34,310</end-time>
                <translation>却一直难以拿起的经典名著</translation>
                <original>なかなか手に取ることができない名著を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="16" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:34,310</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:35,360</end-time>
                <translation>用25分钟一集 共4集</translation>
                <original>25分かける4回</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="17" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:35,360</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:37,380</end-time>
                <translation>也就是用100分钟通俗易懂地解读</translation>
                <original>つまり100分で分かりやすく読み解く</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="18" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:37,380</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:38,980</end-time>
                <translation>100分de名著 堀尾正明</translation>
                <original>100分de名著堀尾正明です</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="19" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:38,980</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:39,980</end-time>
                <translation>泷口友里奈
瀧口友里奈です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="20" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:39,980</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:43,409</end-time>
                <translation>那么 这次我们要解读的是马基雅维利的《君主论》</translation>
                <original>さあ今回読み解いているのはマキャベリの君主論ですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="21" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:43,409</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:45,974</end-time>
                <translation>说起《君主论》 上周也说过</translation>
                <original>君主論といいますと先週も言いましたけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="22" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:45,974</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:47,757</end-time>
                <translation>就会想到马基雅维利主义啦</translation>
                <original>マキャベリズムとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="23" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:47,757</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:50,977</end-time>
                <translation>给人的印象是一部权谋术数之书</translation>
                <original>権謀術数の書というイメージがあったんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="24" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:50,977</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:53,491</end-time>
                <translation>但实际上马基雅维利是外交官</translation>
                <original>しかし実はマキャベリは外交官で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="25" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:53,491</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:56,650</end-time>
                <translation>自己作为外交官见过各种各样的君主</translation>
                <original>自ら外交官としているいろんな君主にあって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="26" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:56,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:59,306</end-time>
                <translation>其中倾注了这些经验和知识</translation>
                <original>その経験と知識を継ぎ込んで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="27" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:59,306</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:02,278</end-time>
                <translation>将如何在乱世中生存下去</translation>
                <original>で乱世の中でいかに生き延べるかを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="28" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:02,278</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:05,950</end-time>
                <translation>上回讲明了这对于君主来说是一部思想与实践之书</translation>
                <original>君主に示したやっぱり思想と実践の書ということがよく分かりましたよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="29" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:05,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:07,890</end-time>
                <translation>嗯 是呢 而且</translation>
                <original>はいそうですねしかも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="30" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:07,890</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:11,714</end-time>
                <translation>他对祖国的那份炽热的情感</translation>
                <original>彼のすごく熱い祖国に対する気持ち</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="31" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:11,714</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:12,893</end-time>
                <translation>没想到他还有这样一面</translation>
                <original>というのがあるというところで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="32" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:12,893</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:15,250</end-time>
                <translation>让我们对他的印象又有了很大的变化呢</translation>
                <original>またちょっとイメージがすごく変わりましたね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="33" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:15,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:18,655</end-time>
                <translation>那么这次 我们来具体看看《君主论》中所描绘的领袖资质</translation>
                <original>さあ今回君主論に描かれたリーダーの資質を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="34" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:18,655</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:20,232</end-time>
                <translation>一起具体看看吧</translation>
                <original>具体的に見てまいります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="35" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:20,232</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:22,150</end-time>
                <translation>有请老师</translation>
                <original>先生お呼びしましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="36" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:22,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:23,620</end-time>
                <translation>今天担任指导老师的
今日もご指南役</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="37" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:23,620</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:26,403</end-time>
                <translation>也是圣美学园短期大学副教授
聖美学園短期大学準教授でいらっしゃる</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="38" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:26,403</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:27,940</end-time>
                <translation>武田好老师
武田好さんです</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="39" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:27,940</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:28,820</end-time>
                <translation>请多关照</translation>
                <original>よろしくお願いします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="40" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:28,820</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:30,960</end-time>
                <translation>-请多关照　-请多关照</translation>
                <original>-よろしくお願いします　-よろしくお願いいたします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="41" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:36,472</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:41,725</end-time>
                <translation>马基雅维利所看到的领袖们</translation>
                <original>マキャベリが見たリーダーたち</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="42" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:42,685</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:46,161</end-time>
                <translation>直入正题 本回的主题是马基雅维利的领袖论</translation>
                <original>さあ今回はズバリですねマキャベリーのリーダー論ということで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="43" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:46,161</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:50,420</end-time>
                <translation>听说现在也有政治家</translation>
                <original>やっぱり今もマキャベリーの君主論を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="44" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:50,420</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:53,500</end-time>
                <translation>将马基雅维利的《君主论》列为爱读书目</translation>
                <original>愛読書に挙げる政治家の方がいるというふうにも聞きますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="45" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:53,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:54,668</end-time>
                <translation>是呢</translation>
                <original>そうですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="46" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:54,668</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:59,138</end-time>
                <translation>《君主论》问世于16世纪初的意大利</translation>
                <original>まあ君主論が登場したのは16世紀初頭のイタリアでしたから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="47" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:59,138</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:02,732</end-time>
                <translation>正好从那时起 外国势力的支配开始波及</translation>
                <original>ちょうどそれから外国勢力の支配が及んでくる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="48" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:02,732</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:05,080</end-time>
                <translation>处于大转折期</translation>
                <original>大転換期となったわけですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="49" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:05,080</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:10,673</end-time>
                <translation>在那样一个时代 如何作为领袖开拓自己的命运</translation>
                <original>そういう時代にどんなふうに リーダーとしての運命を切り開いていくかということを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="50" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:10,673</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:12,724</end-time>
                <translation>就是他写下的内容呢</translation>
                <original>書き上げたということが言えますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="51" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:12,724</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:16,737</end-time>
                <translation>说到大转折期 我想现在的日本大概也是如此</translation>
                <original>大転換期というと今の日本も多分そうだと思うんですけどね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="52" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:16,737</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:20,900</end-time>
                <translation>马基雅维利为什么能够看透君主的资质呢</translation>
                <original>マキャベリーはどうしてその君主の資質を見抜くことができたのかということですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="53" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:20,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:21,841</end-time>
                <translation>是啊</translation>
                <original>そうですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="54" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:21,841</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:26,488</end-time>
                <translation>他年纪轻轻 29岁就进入了政界</translation>
                <original>彼は若くして29歳で政治の世界に入ったんですけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="55" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:26,488</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:29,587</end-time>
                <translation>之后作为外交官大显身手</translation>
                <original>それから外交官として活躍しましたね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="56" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:29,587</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:32,929</end-time>
                <translation>实际上是书记局的书记局长
実は書記局の書記局長</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="57" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:32,929</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:37,484</end-time>
                <translation>以及作为国家元首的秘书官活跃在政坛上</translation>
                <original>それから国家元首の秘書官として 活躍していたんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="58" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:37,484</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:39,922</end-time>
                <translation>他观察的都是怎样的君主呢</translation>
                <original>どういう君主の人を見ていたんですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="59" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:39,922</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:43,172</end-time>
                <translation>好的 那么接下来介绍一下他生活的时代</translation>
                <original>はいそれでは彼が生きていた時代の</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="60" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:43,172</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:46,678</end-time>
                <translation>介绍一下佛罗伦萨的领袖们</translation>
                <original>フィレンセのリーダーたちについてご紹介していきましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="61" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:46,678</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:48,531</end-time>
                <translation>那么第一位</translation>
                <original>ではまず最初に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="62" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:48,531</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:51,858</end-time>
                <translation>这个张图上周也那来了呢</translation>
                <original>これ先週に持ってきましたね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="63" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:51,858</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:56,719</end-time>
                <translation>他正好处于文艺复兴的鼎盛时期</translation>
                <original>彼はちょうどルネッサンス華やかなりし頃</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="64" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:56,719</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:59,451</end-time>
                <translation>是被称为一代明君的人物</translation>
                <original>大変な名君と言われた人ですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="65" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:02,372</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:05,572</end-time>
                <translation>资助了许多艺术家</translation>
                <original>たくさんの芸術家たちを支援して</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="66" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:05,572</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:11,286</end-time>
                <translation>而且在掌握人心方面也非常擅长</translation>
                <original>それで人身を掌握するのにもそういうのに長けていた人なんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="67" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:11,286</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:13,114</end-time>
                <translation>这张脸看起来很有威严呢</translation>
                <original>なんかキリッとした顔してますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="68" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:13,114</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:16,415</end-time>
                <translation>这种面孔被称为“美第奇脸”</translation>
                <original>ちょうどこの辺りがメディチ顔なんて言われている</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="69" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:16,415</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:17,700</end-time>
                <translation>叫“美第奇脸”吗</translation>
                <original>メディチガオって言うんですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="70" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:17,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:18,940</end-time>
                <translation>是指哪里呢</translation>
                <original>どこら辺ですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="71" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:18,940</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:20,800</end-time>
                <translation>就是下颌稍微有点宽的感觉</translation>
                <original>少しエラの張った感じの</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="72" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:20,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:22,104</end-time>
                <translation>下巴这边呢</translation>
                <original>ここら辺ね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="73" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:23,653</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:26,751</end-time>
                <translation>正好在他去世之后</translation>
                <original>ちょうど彼が亡くなった後ですが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="74" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:26,751</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:29,875</end-time>
                <translation>法国入侵了意大利</translation>
                <original>フランスがイタリアに侵攻してきますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="75" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:29,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:34,040</end-time>
                <translation>在这种动荡政局无法安定的时候出现的</translation>
                <original>そういう不安定な政情が落ち着かない時に出てくる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="76" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:34,040</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:36,833</end-time>
                <translation>下一位领袖 就是这位</translation>
                <original>次のリーダーがこちら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="77" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:04:36,833</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:39,120</end-time>
                <translation>修道士萨伏那罗拉</translation>
                <original>修道士サヴォナローラです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="78" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:39,120</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:40,660</end-time>
                <translation>看起来有点可疑呢</translation>
                <original>なんかちょっと怪しげですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="79" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:40,660</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:41,785</end-time>
                <translation>长着鹰钩鼻呢</translation>
                <original>鷲鼻ですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="80" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:41,785</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:44,452</end-time>
                <translation>是啊 很有特点</translation>
                <original>そうですね特徴的ですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="81" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:44,452</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:48,337</end-time>
                <translation>他自称是预言家</translation>
                <original>彼は自分を預言者だとそういうふうに言いまして</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="82" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:48,337</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:50,800</end-time>
                <translation>获取了人们的信任</translation>
                <original>人々の心をつかみました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="83" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:54,141</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:58,775</end-time>
                <translation>他说不能再过这么优雅的生活了</translation>
                <original>こんな優雅な らしをしていてはいけないということで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="84" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:58,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:01,695</end-time>
                <translation>按照基督教教义严格地向人们宣讲</translation>
                <original>キリスト教的にきちっと説いたわけですから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="85" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:01,695</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:03,904</end-time>
                <translation>他说的话虽然是对的</translation>
                <original>言っていることは正しかったんですけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="86" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:03,904</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:06,901</end-time>
                <translation>但结果却失去了人心</translation>
                <original>結果として人心が離れてしまって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="87" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:06,901</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:09,060</end-time>
                <translation>最终被处以死刑</translation>
                <original>最終的には処刑されてしまうんですよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="88" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:09,060</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:11,127</end-time>
                <translation>啊 这样啊 在动荡的时代啊</translation>
                <original>あっそうですか不安定な時代はね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="89" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:11,127</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:16,450</end-time>
                <translation>就会出现这种占卜师式的人物</translation>
                <original>こういう占い師的な人物が出てきて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="90" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:16,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:19,497</end-time>
                <translation>把民众稍微迷惑了一下</translation>
                <original>民衆を少し惑わしちゃったんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="91" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:19,497</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:23,332</end-time>
                <translation>接下来是成为共和制的佛罗伦萨的领袖</translation>
                <original>その次に共和制となったフィレンツェのリーダー</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="92" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:05:23,332</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:27,280</end-time>
                <translation>就是这位 名叫皮耶罗·索德里尼</translation>
                <original>それがこちらピエロ・ソデリーニという人ですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="93" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:27,280</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:30,366</end-time>
                <translation>上一集出现过的索德里尼</translation>
                <original>前回出てきましたソデリーニ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="94" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:30,366</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:33,693</end-time>
                <translation>索德里尼是马基雅维利的上司</translation>
                <original>ソデリーニはマキャベリーの上司</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="95" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:33,693</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:36,309</end-time>
                <translation>是一位守法公正的人物</translation>
                <original>法を守る公正な人物でしたが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="96" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:36,309</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:38,366</end-time>
                <translation>但无法应对战乱之世
戦乱の世に対応できず</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="97" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:38,366</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:41,845</end-time>
                <translation>最终被赶下了领袖之位</translation>
                <original>リーダーの座を追われてしまいます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="98" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:41,845</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:45,300</end-time>
                <translation>那么马基雅维利选择的理想君主是</translation>
                <original>ではマキャベリーが選んだ理想の君主とは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="99" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:46,899</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:52,080</end-time>
                <translation>就是这位 大名鼎鼎的切萨雷·博尔贾</translation>
                <original>こちらですかの有名なチェーザレ・ボルジアという人が</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="100" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:52,080</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:52,800</end-time>
                <translation>就是这位</translation>
                <original>こちらですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="101" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:52,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:57,200</end-time>
                <translation>- 他好帅啊　- 确实</translation>
                <original>-かっこいいなって思ったんですけれども　-確かに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="102" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:57,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:59,320</end-time>
                <translation>确实相当帅</translation>
                <original>なかなかかっこいいですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="103" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:59,320</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:01,940</end-time>
                <translation>-神情坚毅 -长了张受女性欢迎的脸呢</translation>
                <original>-キリッとしている-女性から好かれる顔ですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="104" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:01,940</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:06,580</end-time>
                <translation>是的 马基雅维利见到他的瞬间也有种被迷住的感觉</translation>
                <original>はいマキャベリーもあった瞬間に惚れ込んでしまったところがあるんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="105" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:06,580</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:08,053</end-time>
                <translation>哪里？怎么个迷住法？</translation>
                <original>どこが?どうしたら?</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="106" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:08,053</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:10,389</end-time>
                <translation>首先是他勇猛果敢这一点</translation>
                <original>まず勇猛果敢であるということ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="107" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:10,389</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:13,157</end-time>
                <translation>他率领军队在意大利各地</translation>
                <original>彼は軍隊を率いてイタリア各地を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="108" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:13,157</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:18,490</end-time>
                <translation>为了建设强力国家 不断征战</translation>
                <original>強行国家を建設するために侵攻していくんですが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="109" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:18,490</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:20,624</end-time>
                <translation>极其冷酷
非常に冷酷である</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="110" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:20,624</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:24,230</end-time>
                <translation>是作为这样的谋略家而留名于世的人</translation>
                <original>そういう策略家として名を残した人でした</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="111" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:24,230</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:25,940</end-time>
                <translation>冷酷无道的君主</translation>
