            <t id="" vertical="0" index="127" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:23,629</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:28,100</end-time>
                <translation>他舍弃自己的部下 消除了民众的不满
自分の部下を切り捨て民衆の不満を取り除いたのです</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="128" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:31,426</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:34,194</end-time>
                <translation>人们既惊讶又恐惧
人々は驚き恐れ</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="129" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:34,194</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:37,774</end-time>
                <translation>继而对他心生敬畏</translation>
                <original>そして彼を敬いました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="130" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:37,774</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:41,620</end-time>
                <translation>切萨雷在威慑民众的同时</translation>
                <original>チェーザレは民衆を威圧すると同時に</original>
