            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="132" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:44,809</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:48,040</end-time>
                <translation>不过 虽说抓住了民众的心</translation>
                <original>いや民衆の心をつかんだとはいえ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="133" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:48,040</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:50,420</end-time>
                <translation>但如此轻易地舍弃部下</translation>
                <original>部下をこんなに簡単に切り捨てたのは</original>
                <spell/>
