            <t id="" vertical="0" index="134" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:50,420</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:55,576</end-time>
                <translation>让人觉得切萨雷相当残暴冷酷</translation>
                <original>かなりチェーザレは非道で冷酷という感じがしますけれども</original>
                <spell/>
