                <start-time>00:08:01,544</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:04,040</end-time>
                <translation>夺取部下的性命</translation>
                <original>部下の命を奪うのも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="137" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:04,040</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:07,540</end-time>
                <translation>生杀予夺全凭自己的权力</translation>
                <original>生かすも殺すも自分の権限でできるんだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="138" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:07,540</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:10,204</end-time>
                <translation>他是在给人们展示这一点呢</translation>
                <original>そういうところを見せつけたというわけですよね</original>
