            <t id="" vertical="0" index="149" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:43,339</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:47,380</end-time>
                <translation>但果然现在 仁慈且受人爱戴的君主</translation>
                <original>でもやっぱり今やっぱり憐れみ深くて愛される君主が</original>
