            <t id="" vertical="0" index="150" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:47,380</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:50,582</end-time>
                <translation>作为理想形象 大家脑海中还是会有这种印象呢</translation>
                <original>これ理想像としてイメージがやっぱりありますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="151" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:50,582</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:51,380</end-time>
                <translation>确实如此</translation>
                <original>そうですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="152" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:51,380</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:55,918</end-time>
                <translation>确实如此 两者兼备是最好的</translation>
                <original>そうですよね両方兼ね備えているのが一番良い</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="153" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:55,918</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:57,236</end-time>
                <translation>话虽如此</translation>
                <original>のではありますけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="154" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:57,236</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:58,963</end-time>
                <translation>但这是非常困难的</translation>
                <original>それはとても無理だという風に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="155" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:58,963</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:59,900</end-time>
                <translation>他是说这不可能吗？</translation>
