                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="159" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:08,283</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:11,965</end-time>
                <translation>与那些因过于仁慈而导致混乱</translation>
                <original>あまりに憐れみ深くて混乱を招き</original>
