            <t id="" vertical="0" index="160" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:11,965</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:16,867</end-time>
                <translation>最终放任杀戮和掠夺的君主相比</translation>
                <original>やがては殺戮や略奪を欲しいままにする君主に比べれば</original>
                <spell/>
