            <t id="" vertical="0" index="162" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:22,220</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:26,034</end-time>
                <translation>反而会成为更加仁慈的人</translation>
                <original>ずっと憐れみ深い人物になるからだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="163" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:26,034</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:27,304</end-time>
                <translation>他这样写道呢</translation>
                <original>こんな風に言っていますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="164" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:27,304</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:30,834</end-time>
                <translation>意思是过于仁慈国家就会衰败吗</translation>
                <original>憐れみ深いと国はダメになってしまうということですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="165" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:30,834</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:34,008</end-time>
                <translation>是的 正如索德里尼的例子所示</translation>
                <original>そうですねソデリーニの例にもあったように</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="166" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
