                <original>そのプロセスの中でいかにひどいことをしても</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="175" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:58,616</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:01,232</end-time>
                <translation>那难道不是必要的恶吗</translation>
                <original>それは必要悪ではないか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="176" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:01,232</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:05,194</end-time>
                <translation>说是展现冷酷 也只是偶尔展现而已</translation>
                <original>冷酷を見せるにしてもたまに見せるということなんですよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="177" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:05,194</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:06,387</end-time>
                <translation>这就是关键所在</translation>
                <original>そこがポイントです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="178" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:06,387</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:08,876</end-time>
                <translation>这与一个人的冷酷又有所不同</translation>
                <original>一人の人間の冷酷さとはまた違う</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="179" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:08,876</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:11,111</end-time>
                <translation>君主的冷酷是必要的呢</translation>
                <original>君主の冷酷さというのは必要だということですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="180" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:11,111</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:12,558</end-time>
                <translation>正是如此</translation>
                <original>そういうことですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="181" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:12,558</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:18,501</end-time>
                <translation>让我们在这里总结一下君主所需的资质</translation>
                <original>こちらで君主にとって必要な資質をまとめてみましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="182" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:18,501</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:21,574</end-time>
                <translation>在这边</translation>
                <original>こちらです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="183" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:21,574</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:24,012</end-time>
                <translation>冷酷是一点</translation>
                <original>冷酷さということですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="184" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:24,012</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:25,967</end-time>
                <translation>嗯</translation>
                <original>はい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="185" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:25,967</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:28,989</end-time>
                <translation>君主有时也需要冷酷的一面</translation>
                <original>君主というのは時に冷酷なところも必要だし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="186" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:28,989</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:34,195</end-time>
                <translation>如果是指必要的冷酷 那还是可以理解的吧</translation>
                <original>必然性のある冷酷さならばやっぱり納得できるということなんでしょうけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="187" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:34,195</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:36,318</end-time>
                <translation>但是 泷口啊</translation>
                <original>しかしね瀧口さん</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="188" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:36,318</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:37,920</end-time>
                <translation>你在恋爱方面怎么样呢</translation>
                <original>どうですか恋愛の上で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="189" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:37,920</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:39,046</end-time>
                <translation>恋爱吗</translation>
                <original>恋愛ですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="190" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:39,046</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:43,414</end-time>
                <translation>对男性稍微展现出一点冷酷的地方</translation>
                <original>ちょっと冷酷なところを男性が見せつけると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="191" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:43,414</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:46,359</end-time>
                <translation>有时候反而会很有魅力呢</translation>
                <original>結構それが魅力的ななんていうのがあるでしょ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="192" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:46,359</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:48,731</end-time>
                <translation>确实 能稍微冷淡一点的话</translation>
                <original>確かにちょっと冷たいと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="193" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:48,731</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:50,920</end-time>
                <translation>就会让对方反思“自己是不是哪里做的不好”</translation>
                <original>あれどうしてだろうっていう風に思っちゃったりしますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="194" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:50,920</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:52,353</end-time>
                <translation>比起一味温柔的男性要更好 对吧</translation>
                <original>優しさ一辺倒の男性よりもいいでしょ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="195" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:52,353</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:54,520</end-time>
                <translation>确实是这样 这我知道倒是知道</translation>
                <original>そうなんですよねっていうのは確かにあります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="196" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:54,520</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:01,038</end-time>
                <translation>但是要自己对对方刻意表现出冷酷</translation>
                <original>でもだからといって自分が相手に対して あえて冷酷にするっていうのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="197" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:01,038</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:03,958</end-time>
                <translation>又怕对方觉得我无情</translation>
                <original>ちょっとあの子は冷酷だよねみたいな感じで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="198" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:03,958</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:06,300</end-time>
                <translation>“泷口意外地无情 很让人意外呢”这种</translation>
                <original>瀧口さんって意外と冷酷なところなんだよねっていう意外でしょ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="199" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:06,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:08,340</end-time>
                <translation>是啊 如果被传出那样的谣言</translation>
                <original>そうなんですよそんな噂を立てられたら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="200" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:08,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:10,383</end-time>
                <translation>我会很痛苦的</translation>
                <original>結構苦しいですから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="201" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:10,383</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:14,954</end-time>
                <translation>关于谣言 《君主论》中是这样说的</translation>
                <original>噂について君主論ではこう言っています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="202" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:14,954</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:19,500</end-time>
                <translation>身为君主者 为了使自己的臣民团结一致
君主たる者は自分の領民を結束させ</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="203" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:19,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:21,564</end-time>
                <translation>并让他们宣誓效忠</translation>
                <original>忠誠を誓わすためには</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="204" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:21,564</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:25,849</end-time>
                <translation>不应在意冷酷之类的恶名</translation>
                <original>冷酷だなどの悪評を何ら気にかけるべきではない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="205" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:27,626</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:29,658</end-time>
                <translation>总之就是不能动摇</translation>
                <original>要はブレるんじゃないと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="206" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:29,658</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:32,223</end-time>
                <translation>不能在意别人的眼光</translation>
                <original>人の目を気にしていてはいけないということなんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="207" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:32,223</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:33,569</end-time>
                <translation>这样啊</translation>
                <original>そうなんですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="208" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:33,569</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:36,245</end-time>
                <translation>即使被人说那个君主很冷酷</translation>
                <original>冷酷だよあの君主はと言われても</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="209" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:36,245</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:39,815</end-time>
                <translation>也不要动摇 这种坚定的态度</translation>
                <original>ブレるなとこういうブレない態度が</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="210" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:39,815</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:42,991</end-time>
                <translation>在多大程度上是作为领袖的资质</translation>
                <original>いかにリーダーたる素質かどうかって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="211" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:42,991</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:44,460</end-time>
                <translation>虽然经常这么说</translation>
                <original>よく言われますけども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="212" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:44,460</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:46,760</end-time>
                <translation>从某种意义上说就是决断力吧</translation>
                <original>決断力っていうことですかねある意味</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="213" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:47,471</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:54,927</end-time>
                <translation>然后另一点是 被人爱戴还是被人畏惧</translation>
                <original>そしてもう一つが愛されるかそれとも恐れられるか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="214" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:54,927</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:58,860</end-time>
                <translation>然后另一点是 被人爱戴还是被人畏惧</translation>
                <original>そしてもう一つが愛されるかそれとも恐れられるか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="215" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:58,860</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:01,606</end-time>
                <translation>就是这两者之一</translation>
                <original>そのどちらかということなんですけれどもね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="216" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:01,606</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:03,506</end-time>
                <translation>两者兼备</translation>
                <original>両方の要素があるのが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="217" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:03,506</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:07,193</end-time>
                <translation>虽然是最理想的君主形象</translation>
                <original>最も望ましい君主の理想像ではあるんですけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="218" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:07,193</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:09,427</end-time>
                <translation>但那现实中是不可能的</translation>
                <original>それは無理だということで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="219" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:09,427</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:13,998</end-time>
                <translation>因此他说 既然如此 被人畏惧更好</translation>
                <original>それならば恐れられる方が良いと彼は言っているんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="220" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:13,998</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:18,011</end-time>
                <translation>作为君主所需的另一个资质</translation>
                <original>君主に必要な資質としてもう一つ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="221" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:18,011</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:19,722</end-time>
                <translation>被人畏惧</translation>
                <original>恐れられること</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="222" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:19,722</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:23,624</end-time>
                <translation>要成为令人畏惧的存在</translation>
                <original>恐れられる存在であるべきことって言ってますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="223" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:25,401</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:27,696</end-time>
                <translation>为什么君主与其被人爱戴</translation>
                <original>どうして君主は愛されるよりも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="224" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:27,696</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:30,175</end-time>
                <translation>成为令人畏惧的存在会更好呢</translation>
                <original>恐れられる存在の方がいいんですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="225" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:30,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:31,901</end-time>
                <translation>令人畏惧的心情</translation>
                <original>恐れられる気持</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="226" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:31,901</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:36,702</end-time>
                <translation>在某种程度上可以由第三方来控制</translation>
                <original>ちというのはある程度第三者がコントロールすることができますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="227" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:36,702</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:39,546</end-time>
                <translation>比如奥尔科的例子也是如此</translation>
                <original>例えばオルコの例もそうですけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="228" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:39,546</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:42,111</end-time>
                <translation>通过处刑来杀一儆百</translation>
                <original>処刑をすることによってそういう見せしめ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="229" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:42,111</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:45,740</end-time>
                <translation>这样人们自然就会感到畏惧</translation>
                <original>すると人々は自然と恐れてしまいますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="230" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:45,740</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:47,469</end-time>
                <translation>就会变得老实</translation>
                <original>おとなしくなってしまいます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="231" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:47,469</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:49,298</end-time>
                <translation>然而被人爱戴</translation>
                <original>ところが愛される</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="232" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:49,298</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:53,209</end-time>
                <translation>也就是说人们的爱是自发的</translation>
                <original>つまり人々が愛することは自発的なものですから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="233" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:53,209</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:57,729</end-time>
                <translation>马基雅维利说人们 会擅自去爱</translation>
                <original>マキャベリは人々は自分たちが勝手に愛すんだって言っています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="234" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:57,729</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:59,278</end-time>
                <translation>人们会擅自去爱
人々は勝手に愛す</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="235" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:59,278</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:00,660</end-time>
                <translation>这是他的观点</translation>
                <original>そんな風に言ってるんですよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="236" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:00,660</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:02,912</end-time>
                <translation>《君主论》中是怎么写的呢？我们来看看</translation>
                <original>君主論ではどうでしょうか見てみましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="237" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:08,042</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:11,595</end-time>
                <translation>人性本恶</translation>
                <original>人間はもともとよこしまなものであるから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="238" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:11,595</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:15,049</end-time>
                <translation>仅靠恩义纽带维系的爱情</translation>
                <original>ただ恩義の絆で結ばれた愛情などは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="239" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:15,049</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:17,944</end-time>
                <translation>一旦遇到涉及自身利益的时机</translation>
                <original>自分の利害の絡む機会がやってくれば</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="240" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:17,944</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:21,905</end-time>
                <translation>立刻就会将其斩断</translation>
                <original>たちまち断ち切ってしまう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="241" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:21,905</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:24,954</end-time>
                <translation>原来如此 人终归是狡猾而软弱的</translation>
                <original>なるほどねやっぱり人間はずるくて弱くて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="242" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:24,954</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:27,111</end-time>
                <translation>邪恶的存在</translation>
                <original>邪なものであると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="243" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:27,111</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:31,429</end-time>
                <translation>以这样的人为对象的正是政治</translation>
                <original>でそういう人間を相手にしているのが政治だから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="244" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:31,429</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:34,552</end-time>
                <translation>以这个大前提来考虑的话</translation>
                <original>そういう大前提で考えると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="245" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:34,552</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:36,632</end-time>
                <translation>就要做好防备</translation>
                <original>それに備えなさいっていうのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="246" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:36,632</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:38,340</end-time>
                <translation>虽然听起来像是在说理所当然的事</translation>
                <original>ねえことを言ってるようなもんですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="247" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:38,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:40,698</end-time>
                <translation>但能如此直白地</translation>
                <original>あんまりでもあんまりストレートにね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="248" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:40,698</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:43,618</end-time>
                <translation>- 说出“邪恶”这种话　- 总觉得有点伤感</translation>
                <original>-邪なとか言えるとね -なんかちょっと切ない気持ち</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="249" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:43,618</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:45,739</end-time>
                <translation>确实会让人伤感呢</translation>
                <original>切なかったりしますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="250" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:46,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:53,540</end-time>
                <translation>人的容易改变</translation>
                <original>人々の愛は変わりやすい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="251" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:53,548</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:54,683</end-time>
                <translation>那么老师 那个</translation>
                <original>それで先生その</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="252" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:54,683</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:56,790</end-time>
                <translation>被称为理想君主的切萨雷</translation>
                <original>理想の君主と言われたチェーザレって</original>
