                <start-time>00:14:00,176</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:04,680</end-time>
                <translation>被自己施以恩义的对象背叛并抓获</translation>
                <original>自分が恩義をかけた相手に裏切られて捉えられて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="256" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:04,680</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:07,680</end-time>
                <translation>而后他虽然成功逃脱了</translation>
                <original>ところがうまく逃げ寄せることはできたんですが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="257" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:07,680</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:09,765</end-time>
                <translation>却在遥远的法兰西土地上</translation>
                <original>遠くフランスの地で</original>
