            <t id="" vertical="0" index="265" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:29,660</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:32,940</end-time>
                <translation>他具体做了些什么 请看接下来的VTR</translation>
                <original>どんなことをしたのかということを次のVTRでご覧ください</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="266" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:36,098</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:37,964</end-time>
                <translation>1513年</translation>
                <original>1513年</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="267" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:37,964</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:40,377</end-time>
                <translation>马基雅维利写成的《君主论》</translation>
                <original>マキャベリーが書き上げた君主論は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="268" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:40,377</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:42,738</end-time>
                <translation>据传是友人制作了抄本</translation>
                <original>友人によって写本が作られ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="269" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:42,738</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:44,568</end-time>
                <translation>并流传于世人之间</translation>
                <original>人々に読まれたといいます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="270" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:50,561</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:53,455</end-time>
                <translation>《君主论》广为人知后</translation>
                <original>君主論は広く知られるようになり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="271" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:53,455</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:58,148</end-time>
                <translation>马基雅维利开始受邀参加年轻贵族们的学习会</translation>
                <original>マキャベリーは若い貴族たちの勉強会に招かれるようになりました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="272" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:02,186</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:07,829</end-time>
                <translation>他向年轻人们讲授君主与共和国的相关知识</translation>
                <original>そして若者たちに君主や共和国について教えたのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="273" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:10,037</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:13,086</end-time>
                <translation>继《君主论》之后完成的《论李维》
君主論についで完成した政略論は</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="274" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:13,086</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:16,180</end-time>
                <translation>便是题献给其中两位年轻人的</translation>
                <original>その中の二人の若者に捧げられています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="275" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:19,329</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:21,974</end-time>
                <translation>想要培养未来的领袖</translation>
                <original>将来のリーダーを育てたい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="276" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:21,974</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:25,320</end-time>
                <translation>书中蕴含着马基雅维利的这份心愿</translation>
                <original>そんなマキャベリーの思いが込められているのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="277" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:27,859</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:29,263</end-time>
                <translation>原来如此</translation>
                <original>なるほど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="278" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:29,263</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:32,310</end-time>
                <translation>马基雅维利果然是通过自己写书</translation>
                <original>マキャベリーはやっぱり自分が本を書くことによって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="279" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:32,310</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:37,516</end-time>
                <translation>将自己想说的话、想传达的思想表达了出来</translation>
                <original>自分の言いたいことを伝えたいことを 示していったということなんでしょうけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="280" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:37,516</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:39,660</end-time>
                <translation>那他写的这本《论李维》</translation>
                <original>この政略論を書いたそうですけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="281" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:39,660</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:41,757</end-time>
                <translation>又写了些什么内容呢</translation>
                <original>これにはどんなことが書かれているんですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="282" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:41,757</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:43,459</end-time>
                <translation>这部《论李维》</translation>
                <original>この政略論というのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="283" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:43,459</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:48,918</end-time>
                <translation>是以古罗马的共和制为基础来论述历史的</translation>
                <original>古代ローマの共和性をもとにして 歴史について彼は述べているんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="284" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:48,918</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:50,933</end-time>
                <translation>其写作时间</translation>
                <original>書かれた時期は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="285" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:50,933</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:54,734</end-time>
                <translation>据说与《君主论》大致相同</translation>
                <original>君主論とほぼ同じというふうに言われています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="286" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:54,734</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:58,300</end-time>
                <translation>因此内容上也有相当多的重合之处</translation>
                <original>ですから内容もかなり重なっているところがあるんですよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="287" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:58,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:04,892</end-time>
                <translation>他在《论李维》中这样写道</translation>
                <original>政略論の中にこんなことを言っています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="288" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:04,892</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:08,651</end-time>
                <translation>当以祖国的存亡为赌注做出决断时</translation>
                <original>祖国の存否を賭してことを決するばあい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="289" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:08,651</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:10,911</end-time>
                <translation>无论其正当与否</translation>
                <original>それが正当であろうと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="290" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:10,911</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:13,120</end-time>
                <translation>无论是否背离道义</translation>
                <original>道に外れていようと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="291" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:13,120</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:15,620</end-time>
                <translation>无论是否充满仁慈</translation>
                <original>思いやりにあふれていようと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="292" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:15,620</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:17,720</end-time>
                <translation>无论多么冷酷残忍</translation>
                <original>冷酷無惨であろうと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="293" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:17,720</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:21,729</end-time>
                <translation>无论多么值得称赞还是无耻下流</translation>
                <original>また称賛に値しようと破廉恥なことであろうと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="294" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:21,729</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:26,275</end-time>
                <translation>都完全不需要考虑这些</translation>
                <original>一切そんなことを考慮に入れる必要はない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="295" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:26,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:28,100</end-time>
                <translation>他这样说的呢</translation>
                <original>こんな風に言っているんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="296" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:28,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:29,600</end-time>
                <translation>这里写的内容相当无耻啊</translation>
                <original>かなりハレンチなことが書いてありますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="297" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:29,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:33,817</end-time>
                <translation>是的 他说无论冷酷还是无耻都无所谓</translation>
                <original>はい冷酷であろうと破廉恥なことであろうと言っていますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="298" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:33,817</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:40,674</end-time>
                <translation>这一段确实可能与马基雅维利主义有相通之处</translation>
                <original>まさにこの一節はマキャベリズムに相通ずるところがあるかもしれませんね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="299" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:40,674</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:43,163</end-time>
                <translation>但重新读这段话</translation>
                <original>でもこれを改めて読むと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="300" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:43,163</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:46,236</end-time>
                <translation>当时的年轻人一定也相当震惊</translation>
                <original>当時の若者も相当驚いただろうし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="301" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
