            <t id="" vertical="0" index="312" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:17:19,808</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:24,125</end-time>
                <translation>所谓吝啬就是小气的意思吧</translation>
                <original>この吝嗇っていうのはケチっていうことですよね</original>
