            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="313" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:17:24,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:28,214</end-time>
                <translation>我们来看看具体是什么意思</translation>
                <original>これはこういうことになりますよね見てみましょう</original>
