                <start-time>00:19:24,727</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:27,065</end-time>
                <translation>必须对此有所觉悟</translation>
                <original>心得ておかなければいけない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="349" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:19:28,537</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:32,321</end-time>
                <translation>也就是说 应当拥有踏入恶行的勇气</translation>
                <original>つまり悪に踏み込んでいく勇気を持つべきだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="350" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:19:32,321</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:34,530</end-time>
                <translation>他是这样说的</translation>
                <original>という風に言っているんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="351" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:19:34,530</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:38,160</end-time>
                <translation>君主在必要的时候也要踏入恶行</translation>
