                <start-time>00:20:03,252</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:08,331</end-time>
                <translation>那个野兽 也就是君主应该学习的动物</translation>
                <original>その野獣つまり君主が学ぶべき動物には</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="360" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
