            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="363" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:20:14,527</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:18,007</end-time>
                <translation>从狮子身上应该能想象得到</translation>
                <original>このライオンからは想像できると思うんですが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="364" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:20:18,007</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:20,013</end-time>
                <translation>首先是力量</translation>
                <original>まず力なんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="365" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:20:20,013</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:24,080</end-time>
                <translation>另一种动物 大家觉得是什么呢</translation>
                <original>もう1つの動物はさて何だと思われますか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="366" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:20:24,080</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:27,820</end-time>
                <translation>是什么呢 因为狮子是百兽之王</translation>
                <original>何ですかねライオンは百獣の王ですから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="367" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:20:27,820</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:29,820</end-time>
                <translation>光是看到就能给人恐怖感</translation>
                <original>見るだけで恐怖感も与えられるんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="368" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:20:29,820</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:34,540</end-time>
                <translation>是的 狮子就是对周围构成威胁的存在</translation>
                <original>そうなんですね周りに対して脅威を与える存在であるというのがライオンです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="369" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:20:34,540</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:35,910</end-time>
                <translation>-另一种 -还有一种</translation>
                <original>-もう1つ -もう1つ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="370" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:20:35,910</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:39,770</end-time>
                <translation>大象 实际上也很有力量</translation>
                <original>ゾウ実質的に力もあるし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="371" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:20:39,770</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:41,294</end-time>
                <translation>感觉也很宽容 也有智慧</translation>
                <original>寛容な感じもしますね　知恵もね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="372" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:20:41,294</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:45,205</end-time>
                <translation>原来如此能包容一切 那会是什么呢</translation>
                <original>包み込むようななるほど 何ですかね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="373" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:20:45,205</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:47,000</end-time>
                <translation>为了跟上这种速度</translation>
                <original>こうスピードについていくために</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="374" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:20:47,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:48,640</end-time>
                <translation>-猎豹　-猎豹或者豹子之类的</translation>
                <original>-チーター　-チーターとかヒョウとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="375" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:20:48,640</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:49,680</end-time>
                <translation>-是不是这类呢　-会是什么呢</translation>
                <original>-ここら辺じゃないですかね　-どうでしょうか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="376" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:20:49,680</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:51,980</end-time>
                <translation>-不都是猫科吗　-都是猫科不行啊</translation>
                <original>-同じ猫かじゃないですかね　-同じ猫かダメですかね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="377" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:20:51,980</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:53,560</end-time>
                <translation>-怎么样呢　-我们来看看吧</translation>
                <original>-どうですか　-見てみましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="378" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:20:53,560</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:55,947</end-time>
                <translation>-狐狸啊　-是狐狸</translation>
                <original>-キツネだわ　-キツネです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="379" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:20:55,947</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:57,572</end-time>
                <translation>狐狸 嗯</translation>
                <original>キツネはい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="380" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:20:57,572</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:58,537</end-time>
                <translation>狐狸这种动物</translation>
                <original>キツネというのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="381" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:20:58,537</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:02,144</end-time>
                <translation>它被认为是智慧发挥作用的象征</translation>
                <original>知恵が働くそういう象徴とされているんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="382" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:02,144</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:05,877</end-time>
                <translation>因此 狮子虽然能施加威胁</translation>
                <original>ですからライオンはその脅威を与えるんだけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="383" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:05,877</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:09,127</end-time>
                <translation>却无法保护自己免受策略陷阱的伤害</translation>
                <original>策略の罠から身を守ることはできない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="384" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:09,127</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:11,413</end-time>
                <translation>另一方面 狐狸则头脑灵活</translation>
                <original>一方キツネの方は知恵が回ります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="385" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:11,413</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:15,476</end-time>
                <translation>但无法保护自己免受狼的伤害</translation>
                <original>けれど狼から自分の身を守ることはできない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="386" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:15,476</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:17,125</end-time>
                <translation>也就是说 对于君主而言</translation>
                <original>つまり君主にとって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="387" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:17,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:21,114</end-time>
                <translation>需要的是狮子的力量和狐狸的智慧</translation>
                <original>必要なことはライオンの力とキツネの知恵だ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="388" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:21,114</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:22,587</end-time>
                <translation>他是这样说的</translation>
                <original>そんな風に言っているんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="389" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:22,587</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:23,933</end-time>
                <translation>原来如此</translation>
                <original>なるほどね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="390" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:23,933</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:26,668</end-time>
                <translation>那么 将本次提到的领导者</translation>
                <original>では今回出てきましたリーダーにとって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="391" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:26,668</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:28,859</end-time>
                <translation>所需资质总结一下</translation>
                <original>必要な資質をまとめてみますと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="392" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:28,859</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:30,866</end-time>
                <translation>就会变成这张图</translation>
                <original>こんな風になります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="393" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:30,866</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:34,192</end-time>
                <translation>首先 作为君主所需的资质是</translation>
                <original>まず君主に必要な資質として</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="394" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:34,192</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:36,402</end-time>
                <translation>有时要冷酷无情</translation>
                <original>時に冷酷であること</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="395" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:36,402</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:38,738</end-time>
                <translation>要成为令人畏惧的存在</translation>
                <original>恐れられる存在であること</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="396" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:38,738</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:40,744</end-time>
                <translation>要彻底吝啬</translation>
                <original>ケチに徹すること</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="397" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:40,744</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:43,208</end-time>
                <translation>要有踏入恶的勇气</translation>
                <original>悪に踏み込む勇気を持つこと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="398" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:43,208</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:47,550</end-time>
                <translation>此外 还要拥有狮子的力量和狐狸的智慧</translation>
                <original>それからライオンの力とキツネの知恵を持つこと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="399" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:47,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:49,080</end-time>
                <translation>这就是他的观点</translation>
                <original>こんな風に言ってますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="400" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:49,080</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:53,188</end-time>
                <translation>把这些摆在一起 如果说这就是领导者的资质</translation>
                <original>これ並べてこれがリーダーの資質と言われると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="401" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:53,188</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:56,693</end-time>
                <translation>在当今日本 恐怕会招来强烈反感</translation>
                <original>今の日本じゃ何か大反感を買いそうな気がするけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="402" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:56,693</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:00,375</end-time>
                <translation>但实际上 这些事情</translation>
                <original>実は本当にこういうことって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="403" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:00,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:04,159</end-time>
                <translation>或许正是一个国家 尤其是领导者所需要的</translation>
                <original>一国の特にリーダーには必要なことなのかもしれないし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="404" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:04,159</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:06,141</end-time>
                <translation>也许正因为缺乏这些</translation>
                <original>これが足りないがために</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="405" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:06,141</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:09,009</end-time>
                <translation>国家才难以很好地凝聚起来</translation>
                <original>なかなか国がうまくまとまっていかないのかもしれない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="406" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:09,009</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:12,040</end-time>
                <translation>即使当时招来反感</translation>
                <original>その場でもし反感を買ったとしても</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="407" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:12,040</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:14,116</end-time>
                <translation>但从长远来看 也许</translation>
                <original>後の後のようでもしかしたら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="408" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:14,116</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:15,866</end-time>
                <translation>反而是好事</translation>
                <original>いいことなのかもしれないし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="409" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:15,866</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:20,158</end-time>
                <translation>可能会带来好的结果 这样一想就豁然开朗了</translation>
                <original>いい結果を出すのかもしれないという風に目が覚めますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="410" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:20,158</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:24,160</end-time>
                <translation>不过话说回来 君主这份工作真是辛苦啊 这样一想</translation>
                <original>でそれにしても君主というのは大変な仕事ですねこれ考えると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="411" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:24,160</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:27,192</end-time>
                <translation>不管怎样 马基雅维利所说的是</translation>
                <original>いずれにしましてもマキャベリーが言っていますのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="412" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:27,192</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:31,713</end-time>
                <translation>一切都出于对祖国和平的祈愿</translation>
                <original>全ては祖国の平和を願っているということなんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="413" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:31,713</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:33,535</end-time>
                <translation>为了维护这份和平</translation>
                <original>その平和を保つために</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="414" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:33,535</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:36,309</end-time>
                <translation>居于上位者必须承担责任</translation>
                <original>上に立つ者は責任を持たねばならない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="415" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:36,309</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:39,534</end-time>
                <translation>其中可以举出这些要素</translation>
                <original>その要素にこういうものが挙げられるということですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="416" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:39,534</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:41,033</end-time>
                <translation>确实如此</translation>
                <original>ですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="417" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:41,033</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:44,563</end-time>
                <translation>领导者果然需要具备这些素质</translation>
                <original>やっぱりリーダーというのはこういうことが必要だというのを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="418" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:44,563</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:48,194</end-time>
                <translation>从某种意义上说 我们也仿佛被点醒了</translation>
                <original>ある意味我々もちょっと目が覚めたような気がしますし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="419" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:48,194</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:50,100</end-time>
                <translation>也越来越期待下一期了</translation>
                <original>また次回が楽しみになってきますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="420" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:50,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:50,820</end-time>
                <translation>谢谢老师</translation>
                <original>先生ありがとうございました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="421" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:50,820</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:52,621</end-time>
                <translation>谢谢</translation>
                <original>ありがとうございました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="422" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:55,313</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:58,276</end-time>
                <translation>我算是重新审视了《君主论》</translation>
                <original>ちょっとやっぱり君主論と見直しましたというかね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="423" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:58,276</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:00,155</end-time>
                <translation>虽然这么说有点不敬</translation>
                <original>ちょっと不尊な言い方ですけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="424" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:00,155</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:04,193</end-time>
                <translation>人总是希望被别人喜欢</translation>
                <original>やっぱりどうしても人間というのは人から好かれたいとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="425" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:04,193</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:06,620</end-time>
                <translation>总是想成为受欢迎的人</translation>
                <original>やっぱり人気者でいたいというふうに思うけども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="426" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:06,620</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:10,640</end-time>
                <translation>但作为领导者 有时必须成为恶人、变得冷酷</translation>
                <original>リーダーたる者はやっぱりある時には悪者冷酷になり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="427" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:10,640</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:12,080</end-time>
                <translation>也就是所谓的恶</translation>
                <original>そして悪というね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="428" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:12,080</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:15,040</end-time>
                <translation>需要有勇气踏入为整体着想的恶
全体を考えての悪に踏み込む勇気も必要で</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="429" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:15,040</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:17,094</end-time>
                <translation>必须成为能够决断的人</translation>
                <original>決断の人にならなければいけないというのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="430" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:17,094</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:19,176</end-time>
                <translation>从旁观者的角度看 好感度会下降吧</translation>
                <original>傍目から好感度が落ちますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="431" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:19,176</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:22,021</end-time>
                <translation>虽然那可能会被人认为是不好的特质</translation>
                <original>そういう悪いところって思っちゃうかもしれないけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="432" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:22,021</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:25,220</end-time>
                <translation>但君主必须要准备好行恶</translation>
                <original>そこにも選択肢を常に持っておかなきゃいけないというところは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="433" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:25,220</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:27,320</end-time>
                <translation>这一点非常现实</translation>
                <original>現実的なところでしたねすごく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="434" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:27,320</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:30,706</end-time>
                <translation>我觉得对当今时代的领导者也非常适用</translation>
                <original>今の時代のリーダーにも非常に通じることだと思いますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="435" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:30,706</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:31,927</end-time>
                <translation>那么下一回</translation>
                <original>さあ次回はですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="436" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:31,927</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:34,744</end-time>
                <translation>将以“人际关系的秘诀”为题
今度は人間関係の極意と題しまして</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="437" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:34,744</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:39,035</end-time>
                <translation>探讨马基雅维利《君主论》中如何读懂和抓住人心</translation>
                <original>マキャベリーの君主論に見る人の心の読み方つかみ方</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="438" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:39,035</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:41,020</end-time>
                <translation>马基雅维利是怎么说的呢</translation>
                <original>マキャベリーは何と言ってるんでしょうか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="439" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:41,020</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:44,260</end-time>
                <translation>我相信一定会有对大家有用的思考方式</translation>
                <original>必ず皆さんの役に立つ考え方があると思います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" vertical="0" index="440" time="" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:44,260</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:46,853</end-time>
                <translation>敬请期待下一期</translation>
                <original>どうぞ次回も楽しみにしておいてください</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
